flowchart TD
    SP[System Prompt: role, rules, citation format] --> ASM[Prompt Assembler]
    CTX[Retrieved Context: top-K reranked chunks + citations] --> ASM
    HIST[Conversation History: recent turns, truncated/summarized] --> ASM
    Q[User Query] --> ASM
    ASM --> BUDGET{Fits token budget?}
    BUDGET -->|No| TRIM[Trim: drop oldest history, then lowest-ranked context]
    TRIM --> ASM
    BUDGET -->|Yes| FINAL[Final Prompt]
    FINAL --> LLM[LLM]
